            "publication_date": "2017-07-12",
            "title": "Dex-Net 2.0: Deep Learning to Plan Robust Grasps with Synthetic Point Clouds and Analytic Grasp Metrics",
            "updated_date": "2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295"
          },
          "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W2600030077",
          "title": "Dex-Net 2.0: Deep Learning to Plan Robust Grasps with Synthetic Point Clouds and Analytic Grasp Metrics"
        },
        {
          "abstract": "Learned world models summarize an agent's experience to facilitate learning complex behaviors. While learning world models from high-dimensional sensory inputs is becoming feasible through deep learning, there are many potential ways for deriving behaviors from them. We present Dreamer, a reinforcement learning agent that solves long-horizon tasks from images purely by latent imagination. We efficiently learn behaviors by propagating analytic gradients of learned state values back through trajectories imagined in the compact state space of a learned world model. On 20 challenging visual control tasks, Dreamer exceeds existing approaches in data-efficiency, computation time, and final performance.",
          "metadata_retrieval_provenance": {
            "api_version": "public REST API; unversioned endpoint",
            "cache_hit": false,
            "http_status": 200,
            "request_url": "https://api.openalex.org/works?filter=openalex%3AW2968124245%7CW2968210605%7CW2968734407%7CW2968868378%7CW2968979139%7CW2969815468%7CW2969862959%7CW2969958763%7CW2970283086%7CW2970350341%7CW2970531258%7CW2970641574%7CW2971051513%7CW2971569798%7CW2972156365%7CW2972473628%7CW2972570881%7CW2973379954%7CW2973611093%7CW2973727699%7CW2974140942%7CW2975052038%7CW2975059944%7CW2975343435%7CW2975503305%7CW2975634117%7CW2975910754%7CW2975999915%7CW2976436354%7CW2978017171%7CW2978079163%7CW2978455699%7CW2978872346%7CW2979791645%7CW2979808779%7CW2979826702%7CW2980282514%7CW2980414783%7CW2980459401%7CW2981025103%7CW2981188200%7CW2981538393%7CW2981650061%7CW2983040767%7CW2985033611%7CW2986833982%7CW2987146532%7CW2987228832%7CW2987566577%7CW2988394319%7CW2988481796%7CW2988888532%7CW2989624650%7CW2989847975%7CW2990226371%7CW2990766893%7CW2990789643%7CW2991131216%7CW2991137629%7CW2991355586%7CW2991497298%7CW2991523350%7CW2992977009%7CW2993905360%7CW2994073215%7CW2994798986%7CW2995071939%7CW2995653869%7CW2995750307%7CW2995929068%7CW2996264288%7CW2996896271%7CW2997095758%7CW2997154779%7CW2997882704%7CW2997976910%7CW2998010746%7CW2998367975%7CW2998744962%7CW2998784361%7CW2998829516%7CW2999309192%7CW2999778183%7CW3000078381%7CW3000293971%7CW3001279689%7CW3001975179%7CW3002104146%7CW3002569343%7CW3002652589%7CW3003257820%7CW3003650457%7CW3005477201%7CW3005673329%7CW3005700362%7CW3006326483%7CW3006439205%7CW3007345209%7CW3007548213%7CW3008079393&per_page=100&select=id%2Cdoi%2Ctitle%2Cpublication_date%2Cids%2Cabstract_inverted_index%2Cupdated_date%2Clocations",
