            "publication_date": "2008-12-01",
            "title": "PAC-Bayesian bounds for randomized empirical risk minimizers",
            "updated_date": "2026-11-07T11:25:07.637180"
          },
          "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W2067940717",
          "title": "PAC-Bayesian bounds for randomized empirical risk minimizers"
        },
        {
          "abstract": "We present a tail inequality for suprema of empirical processes generated by variables with finite $\\psi_\\alpha$ norms and apply it to some geometrically ergodic Markov chains to derive similar estimates for empirical processes of such chains, generated by bounded functions. We also obtain a bounded difference inequality for symmetric statistics of such Markov chains.",
          "metadata_retrieval_provenance": {
            "api_version": "public REST API; unversioned endpoint",
