            "publication_date": "2024-01-22",
            "title": "User-friendly Introduction to PAC-Bayes Bounds",
            "updated_date": "2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295"
          },
          "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3207223249",
          "title": "User-friendly Introduction to PAC-Bayes Bounds"
        },
        {
          "abstract": "This paper is devoted to establishing sharp bounds for deviation probabilities of partial sums $\\sum_{i=1}^{n}f(X_{i})$, where $X=(X_{n})_{n\\in{\\bf N}}$ is a positive recurrent Markov chain and f is a real valued function defined on its state space. Combining the regenerative method to the Esscher transformation, these estimates are shown in particular to generalize probability inequalities proved in the independent i.i.d. case to the Markovian setting for (not necessarily uniformly) geometrically ergodic chains.",
          "metadata_retrieval_provenance": {
            "api_version": "public REST API; unversioned endpoint",
            "cache_hit": false,
            "http_status": 200,
