            "publication_date": "2023-03-10",
            "title": "Rosenthal-type inequalities for linear statistics of Markov chains",
            "updated_date": "2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295"
          },
          "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4324106099",
          "title": "Rosenthal-type inequalities for linear statistics of Markov chains"
        },
        {
          "abstract": "The convergence rate of a Markov chain to its stationary distribution is typically assessed using the concept of total variation mixing time. However, this worst-case measure often yields pessimistic estimates and is challenging to infer from observations. In this paper, we advocate for the use of the average-mixing time as a more optimistic and demonstrably easier-to-estimate alternative. We further illustrate its applicability across a range of settings, from two-point to countable spaces, and discuss some practical implications.",
          "metadata_retrieval_provenance": {
            "api_version": "public REST API; unversioned endpoint",
            "cache_hit": false,
            "http_status": 200,
            "request_url": "https://api.openalex.org/works?filter=openalex%3AW4390783809%7CW4390784213%7CW4390787329%7CW4390790779%7CW4390822940%7CW4390825346%7CW4390833131%7CW4390833695%7CW4390833824%7CW4390871800%7CW4390871945%7CW4390872142%7CW4390872240%7CW4390872296%7CW4390872297%7CW4390872387%7CW4390872514%7CW4390872744%7CW4390872747%7CW4390872789%7CW4390873054%7CW4390873135%7CW4390873172%7CW4390873519%7CW4390873875%7CW4390874070%7CW4390874113%7CW4390874554%7CW4390874575%7CW4390874615%7CW4390880427%7CW4390889814%7CW4391021769%7CW4391047457%7CW4391109864%7CW4391124766%7CW4391136507%7CW4391157404%7CW4391164171%7CW4391222360%7CW4391272787%7CW4391272793%7CW4391335474%7CW4391345485%7CW4391360429%7CW4391431291%7CW4391462055%7CW4391462196%7CW4391462800%7CW4391463108%7CW4391505377%7CW4391514504%7CW4391555991%7CW4391559474%7CW4391591006%7CW4391591172%7CW4391591468%7CW4391591592%7CW4391620956%7CW4391631244%7CW4391631273%7CW4391631327%7CW4391631359%7CW4391631669%7CW4391670457%7CW4391709247%7CW4391709257%7CW4391724817%7CW4391766565%7CW4391768459%7CW4391799114%7CW4391801209%7CW4391801217%7CW4391823781%7CW4391832611%7CW4391833381%7CW4391833533%7CW4391833894%7CW4391871548%7CW4391876619%7CW4391897469%7CW4391901300%7CW4391916262%7CW4391922034%7CW4391930357%7CW4391940846%7CW4391953378%7CW4391987298%7CW4392013871%7CW4392019320%7CW4392019819%7CW4392090197%7CW4392120419%7CW4392122189%7CW4392132227%7CW4392158151%7CW4392173735%7CW4392181736%7CW4392181802%7CW4392181972&per_page=100&select=id%2Cdoi%2Ctitle%2Cpublication_date%2Cids%2Cabstract_inverted_index%2Cupdated_date%2Clocations",
