            "publication_date": "2024-05-07",
            "title": "SEED-Data-Edit Technical Report: A Hybrid Dataset for Instructional Image Editing",
            "updated_date": "2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295"
          },
          "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4396786754",
          "title": "SEED-Data-Edit Technical Report: A Hybrid Dataset for Instructional Image Editing"
        },
        {
          "abstract": "Web-crawled image-text pairs are inherently noisy. Prior studies demonstrate that semantically aligning and enriching textual descriptions of these pairs can significantly enhance model training across various vision-language tasks, particularly text-to-image generation. However, large-scale investigations in this area remain predominantly closed-source. Our paper aims to bridge this community effort, leveraging the powerful and \\textit{open-sourced} LLaMA-3, a GPT-4 level LLM. Our recaptioning pipeline is simple: first, we fine-tune a LLaMA-3-8B powered LLaVA-1.5 and then employ it to recaption 1.3 billion images from the DataComp-1B dataset. Our empirical results confirm that this enhanced dataset, Recap-DataComp-1B, offers substantial benefits in training advanced vision-language models. For discriminative models like CLIP, we observe enhanced zero-shot performance in cross-modal retrieval tasks. For generative models like text-to-image Diffusion Transformers, the generated images exhibit a significant improvement in alignment with users' text instructions, especially in following complex queries. Our project page is https://www.haqtu.me/Recap-Datacomp-1B/",
          "metadata_retrieval_provenance": {
            "api_version": "public REST API; unversioned endpoint",
            "cache_hit": false,
            "http_status": 200,
            "request_url": "https://api.openalex.org/works?filter=openalex%3AW4395474395%7CW4395484085%7CW4395686609%7CW4395960232%7CW4396570275%7CW4396571402%7CW4396601642%7CW4396650431%7CW4396651299%7CW4396723768%7CW4396731199%7CW4396772064%7CW4396778191%7CW4396782929%7CW4396786754%7CW4396812217%7CW4396814597%7CW4396815229%7CW4396816845%7CW4396818380%7CW4396818449%7CW4396820464%7CW4396821494%7CW4396821501%7CW4396822569%7CW4396822575%7CW4396828203%7CW4396843966%7CW4396878152%7CW4396912840%7CW4396912938%7CW4396936305%7CW4397009076%7CW4397028377%7CW4397049097%7CW4398151485%7CW4398159307%7CW4398192846%7CW4398195451%7CW4398201291%7CW4398202743%7CW4398796573%7CW4398879428%7CW4398886776%7CW4399115971%7CW4399252504%7CW4399252995%7CW4399270457%7CW4399295484%7CW4399401050%7CW4399415807%7CW4399424696%7CW4399424727%7CW4399448042%7CW4399448208%7CW4399452094%7CW4399454135%7CW4399455376%7CW4399510443%7CW4399510493%7CW4399511950%7CW4399528455%7CW4399530612%7CW4399530856%7CW4399539569%7CW4399554411%7CW4399563930%7CW4399598100%7CW4399598106%7CW4399598145%7CW4399642015%7CW4399655895%7CW4399655920%7CW4399655935%7CW4399657522%7CW4399657827%7CW4399694421%7CW4399695384%7CW4399695759%7CW4399695957%7CW4399750638%7CW4399758271%7CW4399759249%7CW4399759481%7CW4399795196%7CW4399795620%7CW4399836654%7CW4399836817%7CW4399836883%7CW4399837815%7CW4399837985%7CW4399911746%7CW4399912438%7CW4399912930%7CW4399912982%7CW4399913003%7CW4399941107%7CW4399990872%7CW4399991953%7CW4400001790&per_page=100&select=id%2Cdoi%2Ctitle%2Cpublication_date%2Cids%2Cabstract_inverted_index%2Cupdated_date%2Clocations",
